<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>NovaCore | Digital Experience</title>
<style>
* {box-sizing:border-box}
body {
  margin:0;
  font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
  background:#080d18;
  color:white;
  text-align:center;
}
header {
  padding:25px;
  border-bottom:1px solid #202b40;
  font-size:23px;
  font-weight:bold;
}
main {padding:100px 20px}
h1 {font-size:42px}
p {color:#aab5c8}
button {
  background:#3978ff;
  color:white;
  border:0;
  padding:15px 28px;
  border-radius:9px;
  cursor:pointer;
  font-size:16px;
}
#result {margin-top:30px;font-size:24px}
footer {color:#64748b;margin-top:80px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>NovaCore.</header>
<main>
<h1>Welcome to NovaCore</h1>
<p>A smarter digital experience starts here.</p>
<button onclick="document.getElementById('result').innerHTML='😂 GOTCHA! You just got pranked!'">
Get Started
</button>
<div id="result"></div>
</main>
<footer>© 2026 NovaCore. All rights reserved.</footer>
</body>
</html>
